kgsl (2.0.1-0qli1) resolute; urgency=medium

  [ Maintainers.pkg-kgsl ]
  * Use INIT_WORK_ONSTACK() in adreno_request_firmware().
  * Fix buffer overflow check for perfcounter dynamic list.
  * Add gen8_11_x RegProtect list.
  * Add gen8_11_x NC register lists.
  * Update gen8_11_x NC register programming.
  * Add gen8_11_0 snapshot header.
  * Add gen8_11_0 GPU core.
  * Add support for GMU MX GDSC.
  * Add support for three rail memory.
  * Add PC indexed registers to snapshot.
  * Add external core registers to gen8_11_0 snapshot.
  * Fast context destroy optimization.
  * Disable malu gdsc during hard reset.
  * Add support for KGSL_CMDBATCH_USES_MALU flag.
  * Enable CLX/PLX/IFF features for Gen8_11_0.
  * Disable GS Quad primitive for gen8_11_0.
  * Disable pre-mvcc dead draw merge scheme for gen8_11_0.
  * Use CX_MISC_GFX_PWR_CLK_STATUS for GX status on gen_8_11_0.
  * Mask bit CP_SW_RTWROVF for BV pipe for gen8_11_0.
  * Update gen8_11_0 snapshot register list.
  * Add RBBM status info to snapshot.
  * Correctly terminate the gen8_11_0 snapshot register list.
  * Add sized debugbus in snapshot for gen8_11_0.
  * Modify the debugbus list for gen8_11_0.
  * Add GEN8_CP_MULTIDRAW_CNTL to the gen8_11_0 pwrup list.
  * Fix HLSQ_SHADOW_SP_RAM sizes and GMU AO accesses on gen8_11_0.
  * Update the buswidth for gen8_11_0 target.
  * Update gen8_11_0 NC register programming.
  * Add properties to query multidraw and visibility_flush registers.
  * Disable VFD sideband compression.
  * Add gen8_11_1 GPU core.
  * Enable RB BAC strobes for gen8_11_x.
  * Update gen8_11_1 NC register programming.
  * Enable L1A preemption for gen8_11_x.
  * Remove non HLOS readable registers from snapshot.
  * Dump Malu status information in snapshot.
  * Move some RBBM registers to pre crashdumper list for gen8_11_x.
  * Disable HLSQ large instruction async mode check on gen8_11_x.
  * Add support for KGSL_PROP_IS_MALU_ENABLED.
  * Update MX domain memory voltage select for gen8_11_x.
  * Increase the maximum payload size for HFI message queue.
  * Update CLX table for gen8_11_x.
  * Dump secvid registers through AHB path for gen8_11_0.
  * Update GBIF GX halt/ack for gen8_11_x.
  * Fix nc_override restore on gen8_11_0.
  * Avoid DRAW_INVISIBLE_SKIP_INDEX token in visibility stream for gen8_11_x.
  * Add gen8_14_0 GPU core.
  * Add gen8_14_0 NC register lists.
  * Update gen8_14_0 NC register programming.
  * Enable L1 preemption for gen8_14_0 gpu.
  * Update gen8_14_0 NC and GBIF register programming.
  * Disable HLSQ large instruction async mode check on gen8_14_0.
  * Update ctxt record size for gen8_14_0.
  * Update gen8_14_0 NC register programming.
  * Enable CLX feature for gen8_14_0 gpu.
  * Skip sending gmu scaling buffer for unsupported targets.
  * Enable ACD on gen8_14_0 GPU.
  * Add support for Gen8_11_x and Gen8_14_0 GPU with standard DT bindings.
  * Add support for gen8_10_0 GPU.
  * Add snapshot for gen8_10_0.
  * Enable preemption and content protection for Gen8_10_0.
  * Add Gen8_10_0 with std DT bindings and fix Gen8_1_0 gpu_model.

